use anyhow :: { Context , Result } ; use clap :: Parser ; use rayon :: prelude :: * ; use std :: collections :: HashSet ; use std :: fs ; use std :: path :: { Path , PathBuf } ; use std :: process :: Command ; fn get_host (url : & str) -> String { if url . contains ("github.com") { "github.com" . to_string () } else if url . contains ("gitlab.com") { "gitlab.com" . to_string () } else if url . contains ("gitlab.redox-os.org") { "gitlab.redox-os.org" . to_string () } else { url . split ("://") . nth (1) . unwrap_or ("unknown") . split ('/') . next () . unwrap_or ("unknown") . to_string () } }